0026:     - Each row containing grey pixels has exactly one non-background, non-grey control pixel in column 0.
0027: 
0028:     Rule
0029:     - Preserve the background and all non-grey control pixels.
0030:     - For each row, replace every grey pixel by the color of that row's column-0 control pixel.
0031: 
0032:     Key insight
0033:     - The connected grey shapes are not filled object by object; each row is independently keyed by its left-edge marker.
0034:     """
